5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I worry we judge by sound, not by the daily friction on the floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Who actually absorbs the extra work? We treat staff time as free.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
