37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Half the customer plants lose signal for whole afternoons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Tools needing daily entry from everyone were quietly dropped.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
