45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The time lost to copying records is nearly an hour daily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The vendor query handling is repetitive and inefficient.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
